Then when processing `a/b/c`:
1. `findOrCreate("a/b")` is called
2. `rootDir()->entry("a/b")` - finds "a" (directory), then finds "b" (zero-size file) inside "a"
3. `ent` is the entry for "b" (a zero-size file)
